$MDESC::Type = "GoldenEye007";
$MDESC::Text = "<s3><f1>Mission Type: <f0> Capture the Flag" @
         "\n<f1># of Teams: <f0> 2" @
         "\n\n<f1>Location:<f0> The <vServer::teamName0> and <vServer::teamName1> battle each other on different floors inside a St. Petersburg library and its basement. " @
         "\n\n<f1>OHMSS Briefing: " @
         "\n\n<f0>007, I want you to infiltrate this base and find out what the devils going on there." @
         "\n\n<f0>Please try to bring back that door-opener undamaged for once.." @
         "\n\n<f0>Now listen carefully, Bond. Those bombs will be armed as soon as the last one is set. Don't be too close when you set them off or you'll go up in flames as well. " @
         "\n\n<f2>Half of everything is luck James.";